- Craigtarry single malt, refill oloroso sherry butt
- Filled 2 November 2011
- 54.3% ABV, 431 bulk litres
- Currently in bond in Warehouse 1, Craigtarry bond

Once the export declaration is accepted and the EMCS document is submitted and validated, the cask can be released for the Norway export. The guidance I have doesn't cover anything beyond that, such as Norwegian import requirements or carrier arrangements, so you'd need to confirm those separately.
